sequenceDiagram
%% Remote Cluster Review Flow (Oct 2025)
%% Editor triggers server-side detection, clusters faces, confirms identities

autonumber
participant User as Editor
participant Workbench as WorkbenchRoute
participant Actions as FaceScanActions
participant Panel as UnknownPeoplePanel
participant Detail as ClusterDetailView
participant Modal as ClusterConfirmationModal
participant Hooks as React Query Hooks
participant API as WP REST (recognition)
participant Service as Recognition Service
participant DB as WP Storage

%% Phase 0: Trigger remote face scan (no MediaPipe)
User->>Workbench: Open Workbench
Workbench->>Actions: Mount scan controls
User->>Actions: Click "Scan for Faces"
Actions->>Hooks: useFaceScan.scanFaces(attachmentIds)
Hooks->>API: POST /cat/v1/recognition/scan
API->>Service: enqueueDetectionBatch(attachmentIds)
Service-->>API: { jobId, queuedCount }
API-->>Hooks: Scan accepted payload
Hooks-->>Actions: Update result & clear errors
Actions->>Hooks: invalidateQuery("unknown-clusters")
Actions->>Hooks: invalidateQuery("cluster-detail")

%% Phase 1: Load unknown clusters
Workbench->>Panel: Render panel
Panel->>Hooks: useUnknownClusters.fetch()
Hooks->>API: GET /cat/v1/clusters
API-->>Hooks: ClusterSummary[]
Hooks-->>Panel: clusters + pagination
Panel-->>User: Display cluster cards

%% Phase 2: Inspect cluster detail & suggestions
User->>Panel: Select cluster
Panel->>Detail: Mount detail view
Detail->>Hooks: useClusterDetail.fetch(clusterId)
Hooks->>API: GET /cat/v1/clusters/{clusterId}
API-->>Hooks: ClusterSummary + faces
Hooks-->>Detail: faces + metrics
Detail->>Hooks: useClusterSuggestions.fetch(clusterId)
Hooks->>API: GET /cat/v1/clusters/{clusterId}/suggestions
API-->>Hooks: ClusterSuggestion[]
Hooks-->>Detail: roster suggestions
Detail-->>User: Show faces with hints

%% Phase 3: Confirm identities & cascade updates
User->>Detail: Click "Label Selected"
Detail->>Modal: Open confirmation modal
Modal-->>User: Choose roster + faces
User->>Modal: Confirm labeling
Modal->>Hooks: confirmCluster(clusterId, payload)
Hooks->>API: POST /cat/v1/clusters/{clusterId}/confirm
API->>DB: Persist roster assignment
API->>Service: queueEmbeddingIngest(clusterId)
Service-->>API: Ingest acknowledgement
API-->>Hooks: { labeledCount, warnings, errors }
Hooks-->>Modal: Success result
Modal->>Hooks: invalidate cluster caches
Hooks->>Panel: Refetch unknown clusters
Hooks->>Detail: Refetch cluster detail
Modal-->>User: Toast "Faces labeled"
